    Q_y = \lambda \frac{\partial}{\partial y} f = \lambda = - \frac{1}{3} M g \sin(\alpha)\\
    Q_\theta = \lambda \frac{\partial}{\partial \theta} f = - \lambda R = \frac{1}{3} M g R \sin(\alpha)
  \end{array}
\right. ,

